# The structural history database and its migration backups.
#
# Ignored by default because a history is per-checkout: yours records the
# shape of your tree, not anyone else's. Un-ignore it if you want the team
# to share one history and review structural change in the diff — that is a
# deliberate choice, and a good one on a repo with more than one author.
